{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And those who encamp eastward.</b> That is, in front of the entrance of the Tent of Meeting, as written at the end of the section of תרומה." "<b>The banner of the camp of Judah.</b> Since his honor is greatest, it is fitting for the king that he encamp before the king's gate. And so we find with Moses and Aaron, since they were great — before the Tent of Meeting: Moses and Aaron and his sons."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:14.579212223Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}